<p style="LINE-HEIGHT: normal" align="center"><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">1.1</span></p></td>
<td style="BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 1pt solid;PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt;BORDER-TOP: #ece9d8;PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt;PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm;BORDER-LEFT: #ece9d8;PADDING-TOP: 0cm;BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 1pt solid" valign="top" width="75%">
<p style="LINE-HEIGHT: normal"><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">mutlaqo xatosiz yozilgan diktant, bitta orfografik yoki bitta punktuatsion xatoga yoʻl qoʻyilgan</span></p></td>
